description:
After databases are restored, create the dictycr app user inside ArangoDB and grant access to required databases.

Port-forward: kubectl port-forward -n dev service/arangodb-single-diejsnkq 8529:8529

Via ArangoDB web UI (http://localhost:8529) or arangosh as root:
  db._useDatabase('_system');
  require('@arangodb/users').save('dictycr', '<password>');

  for (const db of ['stock', 'annotation', 'annofeature', 'content']) {
    require('@arangodb/users').grantDatabase('dictycr', db, 'rw');
  }

Password: retrieve from the remote cluster secret or create a new one.
This user/password becomes the credentials for the backend k8s secret.
